{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aberrate inc. is a 3D, third person, box-and-button puzzle game where the fabric of reality bends\u2014and breaks\u2014at your command. Navigate through an expertly crafted sequence of puzzle levels as the inquisitive N.T.R.N bot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Harness the power to <strong>ABERRATE</strong>, splitting batteries into two parallel phases of existence. Manipulate phased objects independently to solve puzzles, unlock new areas, and discover the world of Aberrate inc.! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover, manipulate, aberrate. You may be an expert in one reality, but now... what about two?..</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Solve Puzzles!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620390/extras/a35e93e23d73a0dbd2d92734752c3644.poster.avif?t=1760865651\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620390/extras/a35e93e23d73a0dbd2d92734752c3644.webm?t=1760865651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620390/extras/a35e93e23d73a0dbd2d92734752c3644.mp4?t=1760865651\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Switch freely between the ABERRATED and normal world!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620390/extras/3685ca7f55c65a90dcd61c97ed30013e.avif?t=1760865651\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>And Become a Master of Aberration!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_